{
  "$Comment": "Stone Talus rig. Offsets are model units (one prefab block) in titan-local space: +X right, +Y up, -Z forward. The root entity sits on the ground, so Body's offset is the hip height. WeakpointSockets is a candidate list rather than a fixed set: each titan rolls WeakpointCountMin..Max of them at random, so no two of the same variant are climbed the same way. The body slab reaches 4.5 out in X and 2.0 in Y and Z, and every socket sits on that surface — the spawner centres a node on its socket and sinks it by the variant's WeakpointEmbed, so authoring one short of the surface would bury it completely.",
  "ClipSet": "Stone_Talus",
  "BodyBone": "Body",
  "UnitScale": 1.0,
  "HipHeight": 5.0,
  "AnimationPositionScale": 1.0,
  "ColliderConfig": "Titan_Platform",

  "Bones": [
    {
      "Name": "Body",
      "Offset": { "X": 0, "Y": 5.0, "Z": 0 },
      "Detachable": false
    },
    {
      "$Comment": "The body slab is authored 4 deep x 4 tall x 9 long, so it is yawed 90 degrees to put its long axis across the shoulders. Pivot is the centre of the slab.",
      "Name": "Body_Mesh",
      "Parent": "Body",
      "Offset": { "X": 0, "Y": 0, "Z": 0 },
      "Rotation": { "X": 0, "Y": 90, "Z": 0 },
      "Prefab": "Titan/Talus/Talus_Body",
      "Pivot": { "X": 1.0, "Y": 2.0, "Z": 0.5 },
      "Scale": 1.0,
      "ColliderStride": 1
    },

    {
      "$Comment": "Arm segments are a 2x4x2 prefab. A bone's Scale sets both its thickness and its length, so the segment is authored long and narrow: at 0.85 it is 1.7 blocks thick and spans the 3.4 to the next joint. Shoulder (6.3) to wrist is 6.8, enough for the smash to plant a fist on the ground with the elbow still bent. The arms are the way up onto the back, so they run ColliderAllFaces with no thinning: an arm held out at an angle has no upward-facing voxels in its own prefab space, and anything less than every segment leaves a gap the player cannot cross.",
      "Name": "Arm_L_Upper",
      "Parent": "Body",
      "Offset": { "X": -4.0, "Y": 1.3, "Z": 0 },
      "Prefab": "Titan/Talus/Talus_Arm_Segment",
      "Pivot": { "X": 1.0, "Y": 4.0, "Z": 1.0 },
      "Scale": 0.85,
      "ColliderStride": 1,
      "ColliderAllFaces": true
    },
    {
      "Name": "Arm_L_Lower",
      "Parent": "Arm_L_Upper",
      "Offset": { "X": 0, "Y": -3.4, "Z": 0 },
      "Prefab": "Titan/Talus/Talus_Arm_Segment",
      "Pivot": { "X": 1.0, "Y": 4.0, "Z": 1.0 },
      "Scale": 0.85,
      "ColliderStride": 1,
      "ColliderAllFaces": true
    },
    {
      "$Comment": "Pivot is the middle of the fist rather than the wrist, because the smash drives this bone's pivot to the impact point and a fist centred there reads as embedded in the ground. MirrorX reflects the shared hand prefab so the pair are opposite hands rather than two right ones.",
      "Name": "Hand_L",
      "Parent": "Arm_L_Lower",
      "Offset": { "X": 0, "Y": -3.4, "Z": 0 },
      "Prefab": "Titan/Talus/Talus_Hand",
      "Pivot": { "X": 1.0, "Y": 1.0, "Z": 1.0 },
      "Scale": 1.0,
      "MirrorX": true,
      "ColliderStride": 1,
      "ColliderAllFaces": true
    },

    {
      "Name": "Arm_R_Upper",
      "Parent": "Body",
      "Offset": { "X": 4.0, "Y": 1.3, "Z": 0 },
      "Prefab": "Titan/Talus/Talus_Arm_Segment",
      "Pivot": { "X": 1.0, "Y": 4.0, "Z": 1.0 },
      "Scale": 0.85,
      "ColliderStride": 1,
      "ColliderAllFaces": true
    },
    {
      "Name": "Arm_R_Lower",
      "Parent": "Arm_R_Upper",
      "Offset": { "X": 0, "Y": -3.4, "Z": 0 },
      "Prefab": "Titan/Talus/Talus_Arm_Segment",
      "Pivot": { "X": 1.0, "Y": 4.0, "Z": 1.0 },
      "Scale": 0.85,
      "ColliderStride": 1,
      "ColliderAllFaces": true
    },
    {
      "Name": "Hand_R",
      "Parent": "Arm_R_Lower",
      "Offset": { "X": 0, "Y": -3.4, "Z": 0 },
      "Prefab": "Titan/Talus/Talus_Hand",
      "Pivot": { "X": 1.0, "Y": 1.0, "Z": 1.0 },
      "Scale": 1.0,
      "ColliderStride": 1,
      "ColliderAllFaces": true
    },

    {
      "$Comment": "Legs carry no colliders: they swing fastest and a player anchored to one would be flung around. It also leaves the gap between them open, so a player can run under the body to escape a smash and come up behind.",
      "Name": "Leg_L_Upper",
      "Parent": "Body",
      "Offset": { "X": -2.2, "Y": -2.0, "Z": 0 },
      "Prefab": "Titan/Talus/Talus_Leg_Segment",
      "Pivot": { "X": 1.0, "Y": 2.0, "Z": 1.0 },
      "Scale": 0.9
    },
    {
      "Name": "Leg_L_Lower",
      "Parent": "Leg_L_Upper",
      "Offset": { "X": 0, "Y": -1.8, "Z": 0 },
      "Prefab": "Titan/Talus/Talus_Leg_Segment",
      "Pivot": { "X": 1.0, "Y": 2.0, "Z": 1.0 },
      "Scale": 0.9
    },
    {
      "Name": "Foot_L",
      "Parent": "Leg_L_Lower",
      "Offset": { "X": 0, "Y": -1.8, "Z": 0 },
      "Prefab": "Titan/Talus/Talus_Foot",
      "Pivot": { "X": 1.0, "Y": 0.0, "Z": 1.0 },
      "Scale": 1.15,
      "MirrorX": true
    },

    {
      "Name": "Leg_R_Upper",
      "Parent": "Body",
      "Offset": { "X": 2.2, "Y": -2.0, "Z": 0 },
      "Prefab": "Titan/Talus/Talus_Leg_Segment",
      "Pivot": { "X": 1.0, "Y": 2.0, "Z": 1.0 },
      "Scale": 0.9
    },
    {
      "Name": "Leg_R_Lower",
      "Parent": "Leg_R_Upper",
      "Offset": { "X": 0, "Y": -1.8, "Z": 0 },
      "Prefab": "Titan/Talus/Talus_Leg_Segment",
      "Pivot": { "X": 1.0, "Y": 2.0, "Z": 1.0 },
      "Scale": 0.9
    },
    {
      "Name": "Foot_R",
      "Parent": "Leg_R_Lower",
      "Offset": { "X": 0, "Y": -1.8, "Z": 0 },
      "Prefab": "Titan/Talus/Talus_Foot",
      "Pivot": { "X": 1.0, "Y": 0.0, "Z": 1.0 },
      "Scale": 1.15
    }
  ],

  "IkChains": [
    {
      "$Comment": "RestOffset is measured from the Body bone, which sits HipHeight above the ground, so Y is the drop back down to the feet.",
      "Name": "Leg_L",
      "Kind": "TwoBone",
      "Role": "Foot",
      "Bones": [ "Leg_L_Upper", "Leg_L_Lower", "Foot_L" ],
      "PoleDirection": { "X": 0, "Y": 0, "Z": -1 },
      "Side": -1,
      "StrideLength": 3.5,
      "StepHeight": 1.6,
      "GaitPhase": 0.0,
      "RestOffset": { "X": -2.2, "Y": -5.0, "Z": 0 }
    },
    {
      "Name": "Leg_R",
      "Kind": "TwoBone",
      "Role": "Foot",
      "Bones": [ "Leg_R_Upper", "Leg_R_Lower", "Foot_R" ],
      "PoleDirection": { "X": 0, "Y": 0, "Z": -1 },
      "Side": 1,
      "StrideLength": 3.5,
      "StepHeight": 1.6,
      "GaitPhase": 0.5,
      "RestOffset": { "X": 2.2, "Y": -5.0, "Z": 0 }
    },
    {
      "Name": "Arm_L",
      "Kind": "TwoBone",
      "Role": "Hand",
      "Bones": [ "Arm_L_Upper", "Arm_L_Lower", "Hand_L" ],
      "PoleDirection": { "X": 0, "Y": 0, "Z": 1 },
      "Side": -1,
      "RestOffset": { "X": -4.5, "Y": -4.0, "Z": -2.0 }
    },
    {
      "Name": "Arm_R",
      "Kind": "TwoBone",
      "Role": "Hand",
      "Bones": [ "Arm_R_Upper", "Arm_R_Lower", "Hand_R" ],
      "PoleDirection": { "X": 0, "Y": 0, "Z": 1 },
      "Side": 1,
      "RestOffset": { "X": 4.5, "Y": -4.0, "Z": -2.0 }
    }
  ],

  "WeakpointSockets": [
    { "Bone": "Body", "Offset": { "X": 0.0, "Y": 2.0, "Z": 0.4 } },
    { "Bone": "Body", "Offset": { "X": -2.6, "Y": 2.0, "Z": 0.7 } },
    { "Bone": "Body", "Offset": { "X": 2.6, "Y": 2.0, "Z": 0.7 } },
    { "Bone": "Body", "Offset": { "X": -1.4, "Y": 2.0, "Z": -1.0 } },
    { "Bone": "Body", "Offset": { "X": 1.4, "Y": 2.0, "Z": -1.0 } },
    { "Bone": "Body", "Offset": { "X": -3.8, "Y": 2.0, "Z": -0.4 } },
    { "Bone": "Body", "Offset": { "X": 3.8, "Y": 2.0, "Z": -0.4 } },

    { "Bone": "Body", "Offset": { "X": 0.0, "Y": 0.8, "Z": 2.0 } },
    { "Bone": "Body", "Offset": { "X": -2.4, "Y": 0.2, "Z": 2.0 } },
    { "Bone": "Body", "Offset": { "X": 2.4, "Y": 0.2, "Z": 2.0 } },
    { "Bone": "Body", "Offset": { "X": -1.2, "Y": -0.9, "Z": 2.0 } },

    { "Bone": "Body", "Offset": { "X": 0.0, "Y": 0.6, "Z": -2.0 } },
    { "Bone": "Body", "Offset": { "X": -2.8, "Y": -0.4, "Z": -2.0 } },
    { "Bone": "Body", "Offset": { "X": 2.8, "Y": -0.4, "Z": -2.0 } },
    { "Bone": "Body", "Offset": { "X": 1.2, "Y": 1.0, "Z": -2.0 } },

    { "Bone": "Body", "Offset": { "X": -4.5, "Y": 0.6, "Z": 0.2 } },
    { "Bone": "Body", "Offset": { "X": 4.5, "Y": 0.6, "Z": 0.2 } }
  ]
}
